# 运行时产物：API 落盘报告与请求日志不入库
reports/api/

# batch 归档只入库 verify-24（见 reports/batch/README.md；verify-119 本机保留但不入库）
!reports/batch/
reports/batch/*
!reports/batch/README.md
!reports/batch/verify-24/

